OL,3,GNEWSACost of private SEND places up by
OL,4,A429%, data shows
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cost to the taxpayer of sending
OL,7,Fchildren to private special educational
OL,8,Fneeds schools in Kent has "soared" by
OL,9,Fmore than 400% in recent years, a
OL,10,Fformer head teacher has said.
OL,12,FData obtained by Peter Read showed
OL,13,Fspending by Kent County Council (KCC)
OL,14,Fincreased from #27.6m in 2019-20 to
OL,15,F#143.7m in 2025-26, a rise of 429%.
OL,17,FRead, who obtained the figures using
OL,18,Ffreedom of information requests, said
OL,19,F27% of pupils attending special schools
OL,20,Fin Kent were being educated privately.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
