OL,3,GNEWSACost of private SEND places up by
OL,4,A429%, data shows
OL,5,
OL,6,FA KCC spokesperson said the authority
OL,7,Fwas committed to achieving the best
OL,8,Foutcomes for children with SEND while
OL,9,Fensuring value for money for taxpayers.
